# Homepage visual

## Hero photos

Text sits in the wide center column. Photos from the **same** featured post (current invitation, else latest work post). Cover/lead is left; the rest are highest LLM `rating` among remaining non-demoted files.

- **Main photo** on each side: vertically centered, the large one, overflowing past the outer edge of the frame. Top and bottom stay in frame.
- **Secondary photos**: smaller, toward the text; each side shrink-wraps to its lead so aside position is relative to the large photo. Left aside: center on the lead’s right edge. Right asides: center on the lead’s left edge, top nudged 15% left, bottom 15% right. Off the lead’s vertical center; not lined up with each other.
- Wide (>1500px): **2 left + 3 right**. From 1500px–1200px: **only the two large leads** (asides hidden). From 801px–1199px: two-print collage on the left only, pulled off the left edge; right column hidden. Phones: top collage of three prints (lead + two asides), flush to the top (max 40vh, centered — no left bleed), then text. No photos below the text.

## Every homepage photo

- Keep the file’s aspect ratio. Never stretch, squash, or crop to a new ratio (`height: auto`, no fixed height, no `object-fit: cover`). Overflow past the side is position only.
- Drop shadow lives on `.home-print__photo` (tight to the image, not the outer link/figure). Leads and section photos share one soft wide shadow; asides use a tighter, smaller blur so it doesn’t dwarf the print.
- Tilt at most **0.5deg**. Neighbors lean opposite ways.
- A **1px** corner radius. No border, no white mat, no entrance or hover animation.

## Ground

- Header and footer stay **white**. Section plots are flat `$color-greige`. From 1200px up the hero washes white into greige top to bottom; below that it stays flat greige.
- Separate those blocks, including the three columns, with **.75rem** of the white page. No hairlines. No gap between the header and the hero.
- The hero is only as tall as its photos, with clear top and bottom padding. The poster on the left sets that height.

## Hero text

Featured item is the next published current or upcoming event, else the latest post. Centered: kicker, title, place and date, a short summary (opening of the body, about 220 characters), and a **Připoj se** button. Title is upright Fraunces, larger than the body, not huge.

## Section plots

The three work sections only (not Události). One photo and centered text. Prefer a **landscape**, high-rated file from that section’s posts. Section titles start with a capital letter (Svatební rituály, Himmelhaus, Umění). Rituály and Umění put the photo on top; Himmelhaus puts it on the bottom from 801px up — on phones all three keep the photo on top, and the photo is a bit narrower (`min(88%, 22rem)`, centered). The photo runs past that outer edge, far enough that its tilt does not open a gap, and the block clips the picture and its shadow. Two columns from 801px, three from 1200px, with the same .75rem white gap. Stacked below 801px. The outer-edge crop is `2.25rem` until 1280px, then `4.25rem`.
